{"4284570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Blind Box Shop Simulator", "steam_appid": 4284570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4284570/extras/4ca6e513de8b3e24e99f81e303bbcaae.avif?t=1786453321\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4284570/extras_big/4ca6e513de8b3e24e99f81e303bbcaae.webp?t=1786453321 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enjoy managing your shop and the endless fun of unboxing!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BLIND BOX SHOP SIMULATOR is a fun mix of blind box collecting and shop management. Build your store, collect rare items, and enjoy the satisfaction of growing your business while feeding your collecting obsession<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4284570/extras/ff1ed97a863e92af913d34124d073bb5.avif?t=1786453321\" width=780 height=103 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect a variety of blind box products, each offering surprises like rare or limited-edition items.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4284570/extras/5d0e127d1e091dcf8dbe336119d2900e.poster.avif?t=1786453321\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4284570/extras/5d0e127d1e091dcf8dbe336119d2900e.webm?t=1786453321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4284570/extras/5d0e127d1e091dcf8dbe336119d2900e.mp4?t=1786453321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4284570/extras/c336fafe426cb996397555c79deaf119.avif?t=1786453321\" width=780 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience the full joy of unboxing—shake the box, tear open the packaging, and watch the character debut.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4284570/extras/230f784221f561983aecc613ed6ba1b6.poster.avif?t=1786453321\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4284570/extras/230f784221f561983aecc613ed6ba1b6.webm?t=1786453321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4284570/extras/230f784221f561983aecc613ed6ba1b6.mp4?t=1786453321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4284570/extras/63330cbc01e5241282746a123f73b9fb.avif?t=1786453321\" width=780 height=107 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design themed exhibition zones to display your premium collections. Use decorations and displays to create immersive areas that attract customers and boost your shop's appeal.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4284570/extras/e5ed58205b3fa64b91243b5b1fc69fa5.poster.avif?t=1786453321\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4284570/extras/e5ed58205b3fa64b91243b5b1fc69fa5.webm?t=1786453321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4284570/extras/e5ed58205b3fa64b91243b5b1fc69fa5.mp4?t=1786453321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4284570/extras/dcdd2e3f95c1b0161d64675128632a6b.avif?t=1786453321\" width=780 height=107 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit popular streamers to unbox products live, increasing your shop’s visibility and attracting more customers.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4284570/extras/1bdadc53f93637179f10ebce03989df5.poster.avif?t=1786453321\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4284570/extras/1bdadc53f93637179f10ebce03989df5.webm?t=1786453321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4284570/extras/1bdadc53f93637179f10ebce03989df5.mp4?t=1786453321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4284570/extras/5119f74f80de39ad5e8b04ad94c0c476.avif?t=1786453321\" width=780 height=92 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use 3D printing to create collectible statues from popular blind box items, offering unique products for your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4284570/extras/3756d432f68167624a6ea4187e785baa.poster.avif?t=1786453321\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto